                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "003e4c8b-26c9-4c3d-8275-03b9b40c4172",
                        "source_entry_id": "30359eb2-0870-3121-b3ed-adb5a75f1eaf",
                        "source_sense_id": "ad426350-84a4-3532-b936-4fd8ca0b4e96",
                        "target_lang_word": "rizz",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "rizz",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "21ba80cb-b5f5-332c-9b5a-803ae622bdee",
                                        "entry_id": "a4d2d499-81b4-3169-9676-fe059940bb2c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The ability to attract a love interest, usually female; charm or attractiveness."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4296dc40-dca1-415b-bbce-30ece0ca3050",
                                                "sense_id": "21ba80cb-b5f5-332c-9b5a-803ae622bdee",
                                                "text": "Near-synonym: aura"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "839f646f-f074-4fb2-9966-770a0ddd2a23",
                                                "sense_id": "21ba80cb-b5f5-332c-9b5a-803ae622bdee",
                                                "text": "negative rizz, L rizz",
                                                "translation": "disastrously poor rizz; the ability to repel others",
                                                "english": "disastrously poor rizz; the ability to repel others"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5134595c-a4a8-47fb-9d11-065e72da1033",
                                                "sense_id": "21ba80cb-b5f5-332c-9b5a-803ae622bdee",
                                                "text": "Wow, that guy has no rizz whatsoever."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "13ca7a67-2f0e-4f55-a63f-9afdea8a0508",
                                                "sense_id": "21ba80cb-b5f5-332c-9b5a-803ae622bdee",
                                                "text": "You got her number? W rizz!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "80796d26-c450-4834-aabb-b50edf4d6b34",
                                                "sense_id": "21ba80cb-b5f5-332c-9b5a-803ae622bdee",
                                                "text": "Bruh, that girl has better rizz than I do."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "95eab7a4-1ec9-46a5-8c9c-fd65d536d942",
                                                "sense_id": "21ba80cb-b5f5-332c-9b5a-803ae622bdee",
                                                "text": "Baby Gronk shared that he would be focusing not on grade school or a paper route but ... his love for video games. To be fair, the purported \"rizz king\" of the pre-pubescent sports world is probably not the one who actually said any of the above."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "26cd95f2-64e8-4f1e-bd6c-0c0f149b2bfa",
                                                "sense_id": "21ba80cb-b5f5-332c-9b5a-803ae622bdee",
                                                "text": "On Monday, Hill posted a TikTok using a filter which rated her 'rizz level', with it giving her 96/100 and 'rizz god' status."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8a04dcd7-b2b0-4ad8-a329-0d03b0957e1a",
                                                "sense_id": "21ba80cb-b5f5-332c-9b5a-803ae622bdee",
                                                "text": "By now we all know how stilted and off-kilter ChatGPT sounds: blind confidence and a lack of shame can get you far in life, but could it really have more 'rizz' than even the most stilted and awkward human?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "60b8c7e8-251f-42b2-af94-2e99ec1434e9",
                                                "sense_id": "21ba80cb-b5f5-332c-9b5a-803ae622bdee",
                                                "text": "As it turns out, Zendaya's rizz-o-meter needed to scan beyond the bounds of Arrakis to hone in on who had the most rizz of all."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7ef62d03-0715-456a-a842-115067b9224d",
                                                "sense_id": "21ba80cb-b5f5-332c-9b5a-803ae622bdee",
                                                "text": "While Glinda chases boys with rizz."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "rizz",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b2fd0bd5-d1ff-31dc-bcfb-180138cd650d",
                                        "entry_id": "150d7990-681f-3ae0-b48c-b2a4ea44535e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To seduce or attract a love interest."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d5cac238-5ace-4ca4-92b7-f1128bdc6f79",
                                                "sense_id": "b2fd0bd5-d1ff-31dc-bcfb-180138cd650d",
                                                "text": "I'm gonna go rizz one of those girls."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0d528784-3cda-449c-b9fa-c13273162c8f",
                                                "sense_id": "b2fd0bd5-d1ff-31dc-bcfb-180138cd650d",
                                                "text": "In one of De Tolla's videos, he says that Dunne \"rizzed\" Madden while convincing him to attend LSU. In another video, he jokes that Madden \"rizzed up\" Dunne and the 10-year-old stole the gymnastics star from her boyfriend, the \"drip king.\" \"Drip\" refers to swagger and style."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "rizz",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "05265d52-74c1-3955-9115-739405811ccc",
                                        "entry_id": "45686929-a178-34df-81c1-ca2c4e76fa45",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An amount of rolling paper particularly of the Rizla+ brand."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Multicultural-London-English",
                                            "slang",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e0c5127c-b6a4-48d0-9d0d-8a6d7362cabe",
                                                "sense_id": "05265d52-74c1-3955-9115-739405811ccc",
                                                "text": "And I heard that the yutes are lizz\nfuck it, I’m tryna put him in the rizz"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "09cac87a-635b-4c33-82eb-bf98e0bb45bf",
                        "source_entry_id": "30359eb2-0870-3121-b3ed-adb5a75f1eaf",
                        "source_sense_id": "ad426350-84a4-3532-b936-4fd8ca0b4e96",
                        "target_lang_word": "carisma",
                        "target_lang_code": "es",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "carisma",
                                "target_lang_code": "es",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ced31493-ac9c-3612-9c99-34a90b95b43a",
                                        "entry_id": "a1db31ab-c38f-3671-81cc-79939bf08d1c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Capacidad de suscitar admiración o adhesión en las personas que rodean a un individuo."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3678e0f2-7b57-33f9-8a3d-1c2a1d2df70b",
                                        "entry_id": "a1db31ab-c38f-3671-81cc-79939bf08d1c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Don divino concedido a algunas personas o grupos de personas."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7dab9fa5-8857-3e23-b8b6-42ada64f2256",
                                        "entry_id": "a1db31ab-c38f-3671-81cc-79939bf08d1c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Capacidad de ejercer autoridad basándose en la creencia de los seguidores en las capacidades ejemplares de santidad, heroísmo o excepcionalidad de una persona."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1a29143c-406d-4e43-953d-1ee27a4715b7",
                                                "sense_id": "7dab9fa5-8857-3e23-b8b6-42ada64f2256",
                                                "text": "El carisma es la cualidad, que pasa por extraordinaria (condicionada mágicamente en su origen, lo mismo si se trata de profetas que de hechiceros, árbitros, jefes de cacería o caudillos militares), de una personalidad, por cuya virtud se considera en posesión de fuerzas sobrenaturales o sobrehumanas —o por lo menos específicamente extracotidianas y no asequibles a cualquier otro—, o como enviados de Dios, o como ejemplar y, en consecuencia, como jefe, caudillo, guía o líder."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"3\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6abbb584-28e6-4017-a9cd-2802c38be5f3",
                        "source_entry_id": "30359eb2-0870-3121-b3ed-adb5a75f1eaf",
                        "source_sense_id": "ad426350-84a4-3532-b936-4fd8ca0b4e96",
                        "target_lang_word": "харизма",
                        "target_lang_code": "ru",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "харизма",
                                "target_lang_code": "ru",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e7c17d68-36c5-34e8-b591-6804d07ad434",
                                        "entry_id": "e69a02cb-f178-3ddc-8955-8b41905fbfdb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "исключительные свойства личности, которыми наделён лидер в представлении своих сторонников, почитателей"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "acc07f76-0a7f-468b-ba0d-31f27e4f644e",
                                                "sense_id": "e7c17d68-36c5-34e8-b591-6804d07ad434",
                                                "text": "В условиях, когда идеологические установки играют меньшую роль, чем харизма лидера, от того, кто поведет партию на выборы, во многом зависит их успех."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ba1f8d92-06fd-4554-9286-a05b9ce7d55d",
                                                "sense_id": "e7c17d68-36c5-34e8-b591-6804d07ad434",
                                                "text": "Харизма, или личное обаяние, проявляется в том, что лидер предстает перед группой как располагающий к себе человек, способный удовлетворить ожидания группы."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f2018285-02bd-3d19-a0f2-234fd60dc203",
                                        "entry_id": "e69a02cb-f178-3ddc-8955-8b41905fbfdb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "психол. эмоционально-психические способности человека, благодаря которым его оценивают как одарённого особыми качествами и способного оказывать эффективное влияние на людей"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0747845b-5c47-4108-99c4-e0644e76cdb0",
                                                "sense_id": "f2018285-02bd-3d19-a0f2-234fd60dc203",
                                                "text": "Он был священником для всех, очень открытым и доступным, но харизмой его было служение молодым новообращенным интеллигентам."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8c491c0e-450f-4e32-b73e-a56f44932e29",
                                                "sense_id": "f2018285-02bd-3d19-a0f2-234fd60dc203",
                                                "text": "Меня всегда поражало сочетание трепетности, тонкости и мощной харизмы Шостаковича."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
